//! Light in a world a scene hands over: the contract (a G-buffer,
//! proxies, a lens, a sky, lamps), surfaces lit physically or as a
//! painting has them, the sun, the sky the air makes and lamps, shadows
//! and occlusion, light bounced, reflected and through glass, fog, clouds
//! and air, and the renderers that put it together; a camera, depth of
//! field, motion blur, temporal antialiasing and outlines from the
//! G-buffer.
package light@1 { language = 1; ir = 1; }

use "kernels/";
